# Content-Security-Policy is deliberately NOT set here. A /* rule would also
# match /api/preview, which must serve a different policy, and two CSP headers
# are enforced as an intersection rather than a replacement — the app's strict
# script-src would win and block the live preview. It is set in
# functions/_middleware.ts instead, which skips any response that already
# carries its own policy. Do not add it back to this file.
/*
  Referrer-Policy: no-referrer
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin
  Permissions-Policy: camera=(), display-capture=(), geolocation=(), microphone=(self), payment=(), usb=()
